surname><given-names>TV</given-names></name><name><surname>Ross</surname><given-names>AH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Volvulus of the transverse colon</article-title><source>Br J Surg</source><year>1981</year><volume>68</volume><fpage>179</fpage><lpage>181</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7470821</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/bjs.1800680313</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Delabrousse</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Sarli&#x000e8;ve</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Sailley</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Aubry</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kastler</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cecal volvulus: CT findings and correlation with pathophysiology</article-title><source>Emerg Radiol</source><year>2007</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>411</fpage><lpage>415</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17618472</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s10140-007-0647-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>P&#x000e5;hlman</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Enblad</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Rudberg</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Krog</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Volvulus of the colon. A review of 93 cases and current aspects of treatment</article-title><source>Acta Chir Scand</source><year>1989</year><volume>155</volume><fpage>53</fpage><lpage>56</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2929205</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kallio</surname><given-names>KB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Uber Volvulus Coli Transversii</article-title><source>Act Chir Scand</source><year>1932</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>39</fpage><lpage>58</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gumbs</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Kashan</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Shumofsky</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Yerubandi</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Volvulus of the transverse colon: reports of cases and review of the literature</article-title><source>Dis Colon Rectum</source><year>1983</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>825</fpage><lpage>828</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6641469</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/BF02554762</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Murray</surname><given-names>AG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Volvulus of transverse colon complicating labor</article-title><source>Brit Med J</source><year>1950</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>659</fpage><lpage>660</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14772445</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>